# paneldb

Shared package for `panel.db` tables:

| API | Table(s) |
|-----|----------|
| `LoadStore` / `SaveStore` | wdtt_users, wdtt_devices, wdtt_global |
| `LoadInbound` / `SaveInbound` | wdtt_inbound |
| `LoadPanelConfig` / `SavePanelConfig` | panel_config |
| `LoadXray*` / `SaveXray*` | xray_panel_meta, xray_inbound_meta, xray_traffic_totals, xray_config |

Panel: `load*Norm` / `save*Norm` in `db_norm.go` call paneldb; normalization stays in panel (`normalizeSubConfig`, etc.).

Legacy JSON blobs in `settings` — migrated and purged in schema **v9** (`db_migrate_blobs.go`); do not reintroduce `db_store.go` blob layer.

Add tests in `pkg/paneldb/*_test.go` (in-memory SQLite).
